# Keep community docs updated

When you change source in this repo, in the same turn follow **update-community-docs**: patch `README.md`, `docs/GETTING_STARTED.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, and `.github` templates if commands, env, layout, CI, or services changed.

Skip CODE_OF_CONDUCT unless the contact or project name changed. Never edit LICENSE. Do not invent emails or env vars.
